    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43977" root="&#xA;                        نصف&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنَصَفَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He did justice to him:</i> (MA:) <i>he
acted equitably with him:</i> (Msb:) <i>he gave him,</i>
or <i>obtained for him, his right,</i> or <i>due,</i> from (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ</span>)
another: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْذَرَ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنْصاَفٌ</span> The <i>giving what
is right,</i> or <i>due:</i> (M:) or the <i>granting,</i> or <i>rendering, justice.</i> (KL, PS.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْصَفَهُ مِنْ ظَالِمِهِ</span>
[<i>He exacted justice for him from his wronger</i>].
(T voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلَّمَ</span>.)

